{
  "format": "call-of-slop-construct-part/1",
  "name": "Building Station",
  "description": "A Building Station's Core: the dock for its first arm rover (a small one: 9 m reach, 8 t), and the console that builds a blueprint in its bay, part by part. Weld its mouth to the edge of a bay of Bay Blocks (up to 32 x 32) and weld Dock Expansions along the bay's edge for more rovers. A bay builds as high as is clear over it and its rovers can reach. Rovers take pieces off pick pads and Part Pads beside the bay. Pick a blueprint on its screen. Needs power.",
